caption: Martial Mastery Baseline

All Tier 2 Martial Traditions continue to use the shared Martial Origin baseline where applicable: HT 20, Higher Purpose 4, and Trained by a Master [30]. Tier 3 Martial Traditions use HT 30 and Higher Purpose or another governing Martial Potence 6 where those traits are part of the Engine or Tradition.
